<title>UK: Crediop unit sets 500 mln mark five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Crediop unit sets 500 mln mark five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers HSBC Trinkaus and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIOP OVERSEAS BANK LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CREDIOP SPA</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   SPREAD     1/32 PCT  MATURITY    28.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE  S-15.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.882    FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.882</p>
<p> NOTES	S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CI/IT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL AT PAR FROM SEPTEMBER 99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
